		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>助手『博士っ！！
[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]博士ーっ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-26T09:56:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
